Required bootstrap values:

| Variable or Secret key | Owner | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `DATABASE_URL` / `database-url` | API and AAA | PostgreSQL connection for runtime state, config sync state, auth records, run records, logs, and evidence. |
| `NOPSAI_MASTER_KEY` / `master-key` | API | Root application encryption material. |
| `JWT_SIGNING_KEY` / `jwt-signing-key` | API | User, personal, service-account, browser, CLI, automation, and hosted MCP token signing. |
| `SERVICE_JWT_SIGNING_KEY` / `service-jwt-signing-key` | API, dispatcher, git-bot, runners, agents | Internal REST and dispatcher service-token signing. Keep separate from `JWT_SIGNING_KEY`. |
| `AAA_SHARED_INTERNAL_TOKEN` / `aaa-shared-internal-token` | API and AAA | Internal NopsAI-to-AAA authorization check authentication. |
| `AAA_API_URL` | API | Private URL for AAA, typically `http://aaa:8082` in Compose. |
| `NOPSAI_API_URL` | dispatcher and git-bot | Private API callback URL, typically `http://nopsai:8080` in Compose. |
| `GIT_BOT_API_URL` | API | Private git-bot URL for repository fetch/write and GitHub check updates. |
| `DISPATCHER_GRPC_ADDRESS` | runners and agents | Dispatcher gRPC address, typically `dispatcher:9090`. |
| `DISPATCHER_TLS_MODE` | dispatcher, runners, agents | Dispatcher transport mode: `mtls`, `tls`, or `disabled`. Production should not use `disabled`. |
| `DISPATCHER_TLS_SECRET` | dispatcher, runners, agents | Shared high-entropy TLS or mTLS bootstrap secret. |
| `DOCKER_NETWORK_NAME` | Docker runner | Docker network used for per-run agent and step containers. |
| `SYSTEM_LOGS_DOCKER_HOST` | API | Restricted Docker socket proxy endpoint for System Logs. |
| `FINAL_OUTPUT_PDF_RENDERER_URL` | API | Gotenberg URL for PDF final outputs. |
